Aggregating Delta per Bar: TickDeltaAggregator.mqh
The aggregator is the numerical heart of the project. It folds an array of ticks into one bar result, and it folds a series of bar results into a running total. Two ideas shape it. State flows through the method by reference so bars can be chained, and every tick with a valid price lands in exactly one bucket.
The class owns a CTickClassifier and reads no terminal data. The first listing shows its declaration, constructor, and destructor.
